# The private Actin layer lives on GitHub Packages.
@ai-in-sports:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com

# pnpm 10.34+ ignores credentials that use environment variables in a project
# .npmrc, so the token must come from a trusted source. Locally:
#   pnpm config set //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken <token>
# In CI the token is written to the user-level npmrc before install.
